{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":9826766,"ns":0,"title":"Acicular ferrite","extract":"Acicular ferrite is a microstructure of ferrite in steel that is characterised by needle-shaped crystallites or grains when viewed in two dimensions. The grains, actually three-dimensional in shape, have a thin lenticular shape.","description":"Steel microstructure characterized by long needle-like grains","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}